            "icon": "file-text",
            "modified": "2026-11-24T09:00:00.000Z",
            "text": "# Welcome to Lumen\n\nLumen is a small desktop that lives in this app. Everything you make is kept in your own space, so it is still here the next time you open it.\n\n- **Files** shows your folders. Double-click a note to open it.\n- **Notes** edits Markdown, like this note, with a live preview.\n- **Viewer** shows the pictures in *Pictures*.\n- **Settings** picks the wallpaper.\n\nDrag a window by its title bar, resize it by its edge, and use the taskbar to bring it back.\n",
            "sortKey": "welcome.md",
            "detail": "Note, 2026-11-24"
        },
